  "worked_solution": "The function ${S}^{\u2032}(t)$ represents the rate at which the area of the sheet is decreasing $t$ minutes after the beginning of the observation.\n\nTherefore, since it is negative, ${S}^{\u2032}(5)=-7$ means:\n\n$\\,$ *$5$ minutes after the observations began, the area of the sheet decreases at a rate of $7$ squared centimeters per minute.*",
